# Backend API base URL used at build time.
# - Local dev: leave unset (defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# - Tunnel workflow: start_tunnel.ps1 rewrites this file with the live URL
# - Production (Vercel/etc.): set VITE_API_URL in the platform's env settings,
#   or pass ?api=<url> as a query param on the app URL (no rebuild needed).
# Do NOT commit a trycloudflare.com URL here — they are ephemeral and die
# with the tunnel process.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
